{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:43:10+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-11-13T07:43:10+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Associated British Foods plc","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Packaged Foods","country":"United Kingdom","city":"London","website":"https://www.abf.co.uk","employees":140000,"summary":"Associated British Foods plc engages in the food, ingredients, and retail businesses in the United Kingdom, Europe, the Americas, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. It operates through Retail, Grocery, and Ingredients segments. The Retail segment is involved in buying and merchandising clothing and accessories through the Primark and Penneys retail chains, which offer women's, men's, and kidswear, as well as beauty, homeware, and accessories. The Grocery segment offers hot beverages, sugar, vegetable oils, balsamic vinegars, bread and baked goods, cereals, international food and meat products to retail, wholesale, and foodservice businesses. The Ingredients segment manufactures yeast and bakery ingredients; specialty ingredients focused on enzymes, procession extracts, health and nutrition; and pharmaceutical delivery systems. The company was incorporated in 1934 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom. Associated British Foods plc operates as a subsidiary of Wittington Investments Limited.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"GBP","summary_fr":"Associated British Foods plc s’engage dans les secteurs de l’alimentation, des ingrédients et de la vente au détail au Royaume-Uni, en Europe, en Amérique, en Afrique et en Asie-Pacifique. Il opère à travers les segments Retail, Épicerie et Ingrédients. Le segment Retail est impliqué dans l'achat et la commercialisation de vêtements et d'accessoires via les chaînes de magasins Primark et Penneys, qui proposent des vêtements pour femmes, hommes et enfants, ainsi que des produits de bea